{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1138.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"de1319ca1f8c1da9eda47f8f9c3450d80a0dfb1db0fbdd17590c88fb8a2b8f89","ja":"初日の出を見るなら！","zh":"要看元旦日出的话！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1138.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"02b49044a2eae15a6cf5a3986c4e730aebe55ef2a4d151b5247a37bc38541f56","ja":"なんかこ～、め～っちゃ派手なとこがいいな！\nそんで、初日の出見ながら打ち上げ花火もすんの！","zh":"感觉要那种～超级华丽的地方才好呢！\n然后，还要一边看新年的日出一边放烟花！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1138.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"28341808ae57f6515cd3b1996b0e5dd5203a46e13d4d51c6fad021c3afa574f6","ja":"打ち上げ花火！？　その発想はなかったわ～！","zh":"烟花！？完全没想到还能这样～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1138.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"597bba2954942e3f63789f74d5eb1b8729073f027c6bf0f4f079de23fbf42963","ja":"ですが、「め～っちゃ派手なところ」とは\n具体的にどこでしょう～？","zh":"但是，“超～级华丽的地方”\n具体是指哪里呢～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1138.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"d84f13380c75fdaa69723df22c7c82f000694d922623f650dff8ebddbcf3ced3","ja":"そだね～……めっちゃ高くてピカピカしたところ！\nトッテモタカイツリーにネオンをギラギラ～とか！？","zh":"也是呢～……超级高而且闪闪发光的地方！\n比如在超级高塔上挂满亮晃晃的霓虹灯～之类的！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1138.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"ca6d5ff713f78c522358baa368c4a13c2e5db2c10feb6dd00276b8ad75f0e19d","ja":"場所はええけど、初日の出とネオンの組み合わせって\nおかしない？　雰囲気も大事にしたいし……。","zh":"地方是挺不错的，但初升日出和霓虹灯搭在一起\n不会很奇怪吗？气氛也是很重要的嘛……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1138.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"ebc5bd2e4fbfc713bb7904e119def4899cb30cbffd21aa175fb0b037c75eb178","ja":"そや、大阪行くんはどう？　オシャレな展望台あるで！\nその後、大阪案内もできるし！","zh":"对了，去大阪怎么样？那里有很时髦的展望台哦！\n之后我还能带你游览大阪呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1138.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"8413c3b32f63b2888e0a4192c4127614fae7339ed01f059fd0ec5ea79a9f82ea","ja":"あ、それもいいね～！\nんじゃ、おせちは、たこ焼きとお好み焼きで！","zh":"啊，那个也不错呢～！\n那就把章鱼烧和御好烧当作御节料理吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1138.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"7b19d64bcda8d8edd44fb2d09abbe55a7c2de9796a367f9e85fcdd7f352004d1","ja":"う～ん……年末年始は帰省シーズンですし、\n遠距離移動は少し大変かもしれませんね～……。","zh":"嗯～……年末年初正是返乡高峰期，\n长途出行可能会有点辛苦呢～……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1138.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"07ae6f3aae0012bab0c8fac221fcde620cb0fb98ba63599ef2b0227241a711d8","ja":"うっ、確かに……。スタッフさんもおるし\n人数分の新幹線のチケットはもう手に入らんかも。","zh":"呃，确实……。还有工作人员在，\n可能已经买不到够所有人坐的新干线车票了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1138.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"0c28fb8311a725f840d1a86b08ddcc1d4fae29a726c953f96efd2cf9ee2bc3f3","ja":"……では、無理にどこにも行かない、\nというのはどうでしょう～？","zh":"……那么，不去勉强去任何地方，\n这样如何呢～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1138.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"1c04a959b3f5af762f086b770f61111d0483647bd85cbad2ecbae42dbde04685","ja":"えっ？　朋花様、それってどういうこと？","zh":"哎？朋花大人，那是怎么回事？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1138.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"405b4ba224a69fce4f04623ead7eb4e1bc6a8ca0b6badc72e736cbafb451c377","ja":"うふふ……。案外、身近な場所が\n私たちにはぴったりなのかもしれませんよ～♪","zh":"呵呵呵……也许身边触手可及的地方，\n反而正适合我们呢～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
